heretic-starting-rod-infusion = { $user } snaps { $their } fingers next to { $rod }, covering it in a burst of purple flames!

heretic-starting-heart-backup = As your species does not have a heart, your Living Heart is located in your { $organ }.

heretic-starting-heart-none = You don't have a heart, or any chest organs for that matter. You didn't get a Living Heart because of it.

heretic-starting-ritual-no-organ = ritual failed, no { $slot }!

